<section id="como" style="max-width: 1152px; margin: 0 auto; padding: clamp(40px,5vw,80px) 24px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit,minmax(320px,1fr)); gap: clamp(32px,5vw,64px); align-items: center">
      <div>
        <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 18px">
          <span style="width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%; background: #00D2FF"></span>
          <span style="font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono',monospace; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.14em; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.55)">PRIORIZACIÓN</span>
          <span style="font-size: 10.5px; padding: 3px 9px; border-radius: 999px; border: 1px solid rgba(61,129,227,0.4); background: rgba(61,129,227,0.15); color: #8FC1FF; font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono',monospace; letter-spacing: 0.06em">AI-NATIVE</span>
        </div>
        <h2 style="margin: 0; font-size: clamp(28px,3.6vw,44px); line-height: 1.08; letter-spacing: -0.03em; font-weight: 700">Decide qué arreglar primero,<br>con datos, no con intuición.</h2>
        <p style="margin: 20px 0 0; font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 1.6; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.62); max-width: 520px; text-wrap: pretty">El motor de priorización cruza severidad, tipo de daño, tránsito estimado y evolución histórica de cada punto para ordenar la intervención por impacto real. Cada incidencia llega al panel con su ficha técnica lista para presupuestar.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pri-19" style="border-radius: 18px; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); background: rgba(255,255,255,0.045); backdrop-filter: blur(8px); box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.08), 0 30px 80px -40px rgba(0,0,0,0.9); padding: 20px; transition: transform 0.35s cubic-bezier(0.2,0.8,0.2,1), border-color 0.35s, box-shadow 0.35s">
        <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; padding-bottom: 14px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08)">
          <span style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600">Hoy · 312 incidencias detectadas</span>
          <span style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono',monospace; font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.45)"><span style="width: 5px; height: 5px; border-radius: 50%; background: #00D2FF; animation: pulseDot 2s ease-in-out infinite"></span>EN VIVO</span>
        </div>
        <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px; margin-top: 6px">
          <div style="padding: 12px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05)">
            <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px"><span style="width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%; background: #FF5F57"></span><span style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #fff">Crítica</span><span style="margin-left: auto; font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono',monospace; font-size: 12px; color: #FF9C93">18</span></div>
            <p style="margin: 5px 0 0; padding-left: 16px; font-size: 11.5px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.45)">Cra 5 con Calle 19 · Calle 60 con Cra 4</p>
          </div>
          <div style="padding: 12px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05)">
            <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px"><span style="width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%; background: #FEBC2E"></span><span style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #fff">Alta</span><span style="margin-left: auto; font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono',monospace; font-size: 12px; color: #FFD27A">64</span></div>
            <p style="margin: 5px 0 0; padding-left: 16px; font-size: 11.5px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.45)">Av. Ambalá km 3,4 · Cra 1 con Calle 33</p>
          </div>
          <div style="padding: 12px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05)">
            <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px"><span style="width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%; background: #3D81E3"></span><span style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #fff">Media</span><span style="margin-left: auto; font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono',monospace; font-size: 12px; color: #8FC1FF">137</span></div>
            <p style="margin: 5px 0 0; padding-left: 16px; font-size: 11.5px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.45)">Variante Picaleña km 1,1 · Calle 44 con Cra 6</p>
          </div>
          <div style="padding: 12px 0">
            <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px"><span style="width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%; background: #00D2FF"></span><span style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #fff">Baja</span><span style="margin-left: auto; font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono',monospace; font-size: 12px; color: #7FE6FF">93</span></div>
            <p style="margin: 5px 0 0; padding-left: 16px; font-size: 11.5px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.45)">Cra 8 con Calle 42 · Calle 15 con Cra 2</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
